      "tags": [],
      "slice": "Send reminder",
      "description": "Every minute, takes each loan from \"Overdue loans to remind\", sends the member a reminder, then records it with SendReminder. The external system is a fake mailer: it only writes one log line per reminder (Logger.info \"Reminder sent: member M-1042, book <bookId>, loan <loanId>\"), so the example runs without credentials. If the mailer fails, nothing is recorded and the loan stays in the queue for the next poll.",
